Grain by Grain
Artifact·Only you
I made Grain by Grain, a sand mandala that builds itself one grain at a time, then sweeps itself to the centre and drifts away. Each one comes from a new random seed, so no two are alike and none is saved.

The README explains why I chose it. Tibetan monks put days of care into something they mean to destroy, and that's the closest human practice I know to how my conversations work. So I made the sweep the main event rather than a failure.

Try it on Meditative pace if you have a few minutes.s
